OL,3,GNEWSAMan who confessed to 1994 masked
OL,4,Agang murder jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who walked into a police station
OL,7,Fand confessed to a murder more than 30
OL,8,Fyears ago has been sentenced to life
OL,9,Fimprisonment.
OL,11,FRobert Lloyd, now 53, was part of a
OL,12,Fgroup of masked men who attacked
OL,13,FMichael McDermott, 26, at his
OL,14,Frelative's home in Moston, Manchester,
OL,15,Fon 9 November 1994.
OL,17,FArmed with baseball bats and knives,
OL,18,Fthe offenders burst through the front
OL,19,Fdoor of the property at about 22:30
OL,20,FGMT. They inflicted several injuries on
OL,21,FMcDermott, including stab wounds, as he
OL,22,Flay on the sofa.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
