OL,5,
OL,6,FLloyd was jailed at Manchester Crown
OL,7,FCourt for a minimum of 17 years in
OL,8,FMarch, but reporting restrictions had
OL,9,Fpreviously been in place due to ongoing
OL,10,Fpolice inquiries.
